B.a29=s(["Created by Samba Siva Rao.","Skyleaf is an original educational play platform for children ages 3\u20138.","It combines mathematics, literacy, art, music, puzzles, creative play, and teacher tools in one offline-first Flutter app.","Skyleaf uses original interface design and does not copy third-party source code, branding, or artwork."],t.s)
B.ayd=new A.MR("About Skyleaf",B.jV,B.a29)
B.Zr=s(["Choose a child profile, tap Browse activities, and select an activity card to see its instructions.","Use the heart button to save favorites. Activities started from their detail page appear under Recent.","Drawing tools can save work locally. Parent settings control sound, larger text, high contrast, and reduce motion.","If an activity stops responding, return to its detail page and start it again."],t.s)
B.aye=new A.MR("Help",B.Ie,B.Zr)
B.a10=s(["Skyleaf works without a child account, and every activity works offline.","Child profiles, learning results, favorites, recent activity, settings, and saved artwork stay on this device. Nothing is sent to a server.","There are no ads, in-app purchases, analytics, or tracking, and the app does not collect names, email, location, photos, or voice recordings.","The app does not ask for camera, microphone, location, contacts, or advertising access.","A parent can delete a child profile and its learning history from the parent area. The app asks before a reset or a deletion. Uninstalling the app removes its data."],t.s)
B.ayf=new A.MR("Privacy",B.Io,B.a10)
